{"id": "t147-057", "text": "Anders - op went fine apparently. moaning about ice packs. tease him at footie next Thurs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tease him at footie", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thurs", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t147-059", "text": "Sana - her mum passed Tues night, peacefully, whole family there. funeral prob next Fri at the mosque, burial same day. Sana's brother Imran coming back from Dubai tomorrow, other brother already here. I'll go to the funeral w Kate. remind me to sort a card + ask about food rota for the wk after. Sana said her mum always asked after me, which set me off", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Fri", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "burial", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "same day", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imran", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming back from Dubai", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a card", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask about food rota", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "